resources.string:
The runner keeps running along one of three tracks. Don't crash, collect coins and don't get caught.

Controls:
• swipe left / right - switch track;
• swipe up - jump;
• swipe down - roll (in the air - drop fast);
• optional: tap = jump (toggle in the menu).

Obstacles:
• red-and-white low barrier and cones - jump over; hit them and you stumble;
• yellow-and-black high barrier - roll under it;
• solid barrier and trains - go around on another track. Bumping into a train's side is a stumble too.
• run up a ramp onto a parked train and run along the roofs;
• 🚆 an oncoming train drives towards you: horn, bright headlights and a “!” over its track - get out of the way!

The inspector with a flashlight and a robot dog runs behind you. Stumble once and he's right behind; stumble again while he's close and he catches you. Otherwise he falls back.

Power-ups:
• 🧲 magnet - coins fly to you;
• 🚀 rocket pack - fly over the trains collecting coins in the air;
• 👟 spring sneakers - higher jumps, even onto a carriage;
• ✖2 - double score;
• 🛹 hover board - forgives one crash.

The score multiplier grows with distance. After a crash you can continue once for 50 🪙. Every 10 coins in a run = 1 messenger coin (the remainder carries over). Spend coins on runner outfits (including special ones with glow and trails).
